WEBVTT

00:01:57.187 --> 00:02:02.197
I’ve just opened the card that you made 
me, and it is beautiful.

00:02:02.197 --> 00:02:06.319
I really love the way you 
filled the sky with birds.

00:02:06.319 --> 00:02:09.679
I believe that you are chula,
chulita, and super fly!

00:02:09.679 --> 00:02:12.179
Yes, the card is beautiful.

00:02:12.179 --> 00:02:14.839
I only have one question for you.

00:02:14.839 --> 00:02:18.809
What does the word ‘Loisfoeribari’ mean?

00:02:18.809 --> 00:02:22.099
I try the word again.
Loisfoeribari.

00:02:22.099 --> 00:02:25.449
Loisfoeribari.
Loisfoeribari.

00:02:25.449 --> 00:02:28.049
I try the word in Spanish.

00:02:28.049 --> 00:02:29.429
Loisfoeribari

00:02:29.429 --> 00:02:31.069
Lo-ees-fo-eh-dee-bah-dee